<title>UK: Sofinco sets 1.0 bln FRF nine-year domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Sofinco sets 1.0 bln FRF nine-year domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque CPR and CNCA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE SOFINCO</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.90	MATURITY    02.JUL.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.928   PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.7	 REOFFER    99.578    SPREAD	+36 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
